  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity of the Government of Angola to Respond to Trafficking in Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute to a strengthened national response to trafficking in persons (TiP) in Angola with a focus on victim-centered investigation and prosecution of TiP cases, protection of victims of trafficking and prevention through awareness raising.</narrative>
  </description>
